<section class="arc-service arc-tools-page"><header class="arc-service-heading"><h1>Verificações rápidas</h1><button type="button" class="arc-icon-action" data-open-dialog="tools-help" aria-label="Como usar as verificações" title="Como usar"><i class="fa fa-question" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></header><div class="arc-tool-grid"><button type="button" class="arc-tool-card" data-open-dialog="file-transfer" <?=!in_array($teamRole,['owner','administrator','operator'],true)||!$selectedAgentId?'disabled':''?>><i class="fa fa-exchange" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong>Arquivos</strong><i class="fa fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><?php foreach($tools as [$key,$label,$icon,$description]):?><button type="button" class="arc-tool-card" data-tool-command="<?=$key?>" aria-label="Verificar <?=arc_h($label)?>" title="<?=arc_h($description)?>" <?=!$isNetworkOwner||!$selectedAgentId?'disabled':''?>><i class="fa fa-<?=$icon?>" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong><?=arc_h($label)?></strong><i class="fa fa-angle-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button><?php endforeach;?></div><div class="arc-tool-grid" aria-label="Energia do computador"><?php foreach(['power_shutdown'=>['Desligar','power-off'],'power_restart'=>['Reiniciar','refresh'],'power_cancel'=>['Cancelar agendamento','ban']] as $power=>[$label,$icon]):?><button type="button" class="arc-tool-card" data-power-command="<?=$power?>" <?=$isNetworkOwner&&$selectedAgentId?'':'disabled'?>><i class="fa fa-<?=$icon?>" aria-hidden="true"></i><strong><?=$label?></strong></button><?php endforeach;?></div>
<dialog class="arc-service-dialog" id="power-confirm"><header class="arc-service-heading"><h2>Controle de energia</h2><button type="button" class="arc-icon-action" data-close-dialog aria-label="Fechar"><i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></header><p id="power-target"></p><p>Somente computadores com agente atualizado. A pessoa no computador deve autorizar. Servidores com modo sem monitor já habilitado aceitam a solicitação do gestor sem confirmação local. Aguarde 60 segundos após a autorização; use Cancelar agendamento para interromper. Dispositivos sem agente não aceitam esta operação.</p><label class="arc-service-form">Senha da sua conta<input id="power-password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password"></label><button type="button" class="button primary" id="power-send">Confirmar solicitação</button></dialog>
<p id="tool-feedback" role="status"><?=$isNetworkOwner?'Selecione um computador e toque em uma verificação.':'O gestor da rede pode executar estas verificações.'?></p>
<dialog class="arc-service-dialog" id="tools-help"><header class="arc-service-heading"><h2>Como funciona</h2><button type="button" class="arc-icon-action" data-close-dialog aria-label="Fechar"><i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></header><p>Escolha um computador no topo e toque no que deseja conferir. Ele precisa estar conectado e com o aplicativo atualizado. As verificações apenas consultam informações. As ações de energia ficam separadas e exigem confirmação na plataforma e no computador.</p><?php foreach($tools as [$key,$label,$icon,$description]):?><p><strong><?=arc_h($label)?>:</strong> <?=arc_h($description)?></p><?php endforeach;?></dialog>
<dialog class="arc-service-dialog" id="tool-result"><header class="arc-service-heading"><h2 id="tool-title">Verificação</h2><button type="button" class="arc-icon-action" data-close-dialog aria-label="Fechar"><i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></header><p id="tool-result-state" role="status">Aguardando o computador…</p><div class="arc-tool-facts" id="tool-result-details"></div></dialog>
<dialog class="arc-service-dialog arc-files-dialog" id="file-transfer"><header class="arc-service-heading"><h2>Arquivos</h2><button type="button" class="arc-icon-action" data-close-dialog aria-label="Fechar"><i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i></button></header>
<p>Envie para o computador selecionado ou peça um arquivo. A pessoa no computador escolhe e autoriza. Os arquivos ficam disponíveis por 24 horas.</p>
<form id="file-send-form" class="arc-service-form"><label>Arquivo<input type="file" name="file" id="file-source" required></label><div class="arc-service-actions"><button class="button primary" id="file-send" title="Enviar ao computador"><i class="fa fa-upload" aria-hidden="true"></i> Enviar</button><button type="button" class="button" id="file-receive" title="Pedir um arquivo do computador"><i class="fa fa-download" aria-hidden="true"></i> Receber</button></div></form>
<p id="file-feedback" role="status"></p><div id="file-list" class="arc-service-list" aria-label="Transferências recentes"></div></dialog>
</section>
<script>
(()=>{'use strict';const network=<?=json_encode($networkId)?>,csrf=<?=json_encode($csrf)?>,base=<?=json_encode(arc_workspace_base_url())?>;const dialog=document.getElementById('tool-result'),state=document.getElementById('tool-result-state'),facts=document.getElementById('tool-result-details'),feedback=document.getElementById('tool-feedback');let busy=false;
const plain=value=>window.arcPlainMessage?window.arcPlainMessage(value):String(value||'');
function fact(label,value){const item=document.createElement('div'),name=document.createElement('small'),data=document.createElement('strong');name.textContent=label;data.textContent=value;item.append(name,data);facts.append(item)}
function details(data){facts.replaceChildren();for(const volume of data.volumes||[])fact(volume.name,Number(volume.free_percent).toLocaleString('pt-BR')+'% livre · '+(Number(volume.free_bytes)/1073741824).toLocaleString('pt-BR',{maximumFractionDigits:1})+' GB');for(const service of data.services||[])fact(service.name,service.running?'Funcionando':service.expected?'Precisa conferir':'Não precisa estar ativo');if(data.memory_total)fact('Memória disponível',(Number(data.memory_free)/1073741824).toLocaleString('pt-BR',{maximumFractionDigits:1})+' GB');if(data.disk_total)fact('Disco disponível',(Number(data.disk_free)/1073741824).toLocaleString('pt-BR',{maximumFractionDigits:1})+' GB');if(typeof data.restart_pending==='boolean')fact('Reinicialização',data.restart_pending?'Combine um horário para reiniciar':'Não há pedido do Windows');}
async function json(url,options={}){const r=await fetch(url,{credentials:'same-origin',cache:'no-store',...options});const j=await r.json();if(!r.ok||!j.ok)throw Error(j.error||'Não foi possível verificar.');return j;}
let power=null;const powerDialog=document.getElementById('power-confirm');
document.querySelectorAll('[data-power-command]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const select=document.getElementById('arc-agent-target');if(!select.value)return;power={command:button.dataset.powerCommand,agent:Number(select.value),label:button.textContent.trim()};document.getElementById('power-target').textContent=power.label+' · '+select.selectedOptions[0].textContent;document.getElementById('power-password').value='';powerDialog.showModal();}));
document.getElementById('power-send').addEventListener('click',async function(){if(!power||this.disabled)return;this.disabled=true;const request=power;try{const task=await json(base+'api/api.php?action=network-command',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-CSRF-Token':csrf},body:JSON.stringify({network_id:network,agent_id:request.agent,command:request.command,confirmed:true,password:document.getElementById('power-password').value})});powerDialog.close();document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('arc:command-queued',{detail:{command_id:task.command_id,agent_id:request.agent,command:request.command}}));feedback.textContent='Solicitação enviada. Aguardando o computador.';}catch(e){feedback.textContent=plain(e.message);powerDialog.close();}finally{this.disabled=false;power=null;}});
const fileDialog=document.getElementById('file-transfer'),fileMessage=document.getElementById('file-feedback'),fileList=document.getElementById('file-list');let fileBusy=false,fileLimit=<?=arc_support_file_limit()?>;
const fileLabels={pending:'Aguardando o computador',ready:'Pronto para baixar',completed:'Concluído',declined:'Não autorizado no computador',failed:'Não foi possível concluir',expired:'Expirado'};
async function fileApi(action,options={}){return json(base+'api/support.php?action='+action,{headers:{'X-CSRF-Token':csrf},...options});}
async function loadFiles(){if(!fileDialog.open||fileBusy)return;try{const agent=Number(document.getElementById('arc-agent-target').value);const result=await fileApi('file-list&network='+network+'&agent='+agent);fileLimit=result.max_bytes;fileList.replaceChildren();for(const row of result.transfers){const article=document.createElement('article'),text=document.createElement('div'),name=document.createElement('strong'),state=document.createElement('small');name.textContent=row.filename||(row.direction==='from_agent'?'Arquivo solicitado':'Arquivo');const expired=new Date(row.expires_at.replace(' ','T')+'-03:00')<=new Date();const status=expired?'expired':row.status==='pending'&&['failed','expired'].includes(row.task_status)?row.task_status:row.status;state.textContent=(row.direction==='to_agent'?'Enviado · ':'Recebido · ')+(fileLabels[status]||'Em andamento')+(row.file_size?' · '+(row.file_size/1048576).toLocaleString('pt-BR',{maximumFractionDigits:2})+' MB':'');text.append(name,state);article.append(text);if(row.status==='ready'&&new Date(row.expires_at.replace(' ','T')+'-03:00')>new Date()){const link=document.createElement('a');link.className='arc-icon-action';link.href=base+'api/support.php?action=file-download&id='+row.id;link.setAttribute('aria-label','Baixar '+row.filename);link.title='Baixar arquivo';const icon=document.createElement('i');icon.className='fa fa-download';icon.setAttribute('aria-hidden','true');link.append(icon);article.append(link);}fileList.append(article);}if(!result.transfers.length)fileList.textContent='Nenhuma transferência ainda.';if(!fileMessage.textContent)fileMessage.textContent='Até '+(fileLimit/1048576).toLocaleString('pt-BR',{maximumFractionDigits:1})+' MB por envio nesta hospedagem.';}catch(e){fileMessage.textContent=plain(e.message);}}
document.querySelector('[data-open-dialog="file-transfer"]').addEventListener('click',()=>setTimeout(loadFiles,0));setInterval(()=>{if(!document.hidden)loadFiles()},5000);
async function requestFile(action){if(fileBusy)return;const agent=Number(document.getElementById('arc-agent-target').value);if(!agent)return;const form=new FormData();form.set('network',network);form.set('agent',agent);if(action==='file-send'){const file=document.getElementById('file-source').files[0];if(!file)return;if(file.size>fileLimit){fileMessage.textContent='Escolha um arquivo menor que o limite de '+(fileLimit/1048576).toLocaleString('pt-BR',{maximumFractionDigits:1})+' MB.';return;}form.set('file',file);}fileBusy=true;document.getElementById('file-send').disabled=true;document.getElementById('file-receive').disabled=true;fileMessage.textContent='Enviando solicitação…';try{await fileApi(action,{method:'POST',body:form});fileMessage.textContent='Solicitação enviada. Aguarde a autorização no computador.';document.getElementById('file-source').value='';}catch(e){fileMessage.textContent=plain(e.message);}finally{fileBusy=false;document.getElementById('file-send').disabled=false;document.getElementById('file-receive').disabled=false;loadFiles();}}
document.getElementById('file-send-form').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();requestFile('file-send');});document.getElementById('file-receive').addEventListener('click',()=>requestFile('file-receive'));
document.querySelectorAll('[data-tool-command]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{if(busy)return;const agent=Number(document.getElementById('arc-agent-target').value);if(!agent)return;busy=true;button.disabled=true;facts.replaceChildren();document.getElementById('tool-title').textContent=button.querySelector('strong').textContent;state.textContent='Aguardando o computador…';dialog.showModal();try{const request=await json(base+'api/api.php?action=network-command',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json','X-CSRF-Token':csrf},body:JSON.stringify({network_id:network,agent_id:agent,command:button.dataset.toolCommand})});const deadline=Date.now()+180000;let completedWait=0;while(Date.now()<deadline){await new Promise(resolve=>setTimeout(resolve,1500));const result=await json(base+'api/api.php?action=network-tool-result&network_id='+network+'&agent_id='+agent+'&command_id='+request.command_id);if(result.result){state.textContent=plain(result.result.summary);details(result.result.details);feedback.textContent=state.textContent;return;}if(result.task.status==='completed'&&!result.result&&completedWait++<3)continue;if(['failed','expired','completed'].includes(result.task.status)){state.textContent=plain(result.task.result_text||'A verificação terminou.');feedback.textContent=state.textContent;return;}state.textContent=result.task.status==='running'?'O computador está verificando…':'Aguardando o computador responder…';}throw Error('O computador não respondeu a tempo. Confira se está conectado.');}catch(e){state.textContent=plain(e.message);feedback.textContent=state.textContent;}finally{busy=false;button.disabled=false;}}));})();
</script>
<?php require __DIR__.'/_rodape.php';?>
